      "cooked": "<p>The text of Infinitor' \"Whispers of Oblivion\" reads:</p><blockquote><p>Infinitor deals each target 1 psychic damage.&nbsp; If at least on target is destroyed this way, restore all manifestation cards to their maximum HP</p><p>Play the top card of the villain deck.</p></blockquote><p>Does the \"each target\" include villian targets (e.g. Manifestations)?&nbsp; That's how I read the card.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks,<br>Ben</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
